From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Guard X11 accessibility lookup without a display

A GTK build can include both X11 and Wayland. PlatformDisplayX11 may exist
without an opened X display when a client is running natively on Wayland, so
the AT-SPI root-window property fallback must not call Xlib with nullptr.

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/x11/PlatformDisplayX11.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/x11/PlatformDisplayX11.cpp
@@ -193,6 +193,9 @@ cmsHPROFILE PlatformDisplayX11::colorProfile() const
 #if USE(ATSPI)
 String PlatformDisplayX11::platformAccessibilityBusAddress() const
 {
+    if (!m_display)
+        return { };
+
     Atom atspiBusAtom = XInternAtom(m_display, "AT_SPI_BUS", False);
     Atom type;
     int format;
